Package: cnfacML
Title: Machine Learning Tools for Avalanche Forecasting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Andrew", "Schauer", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: Machine learning tools for avalanche danger forecasting using
    Self-Organizing Maps (SOM). Includes season-based and random/sequential
    data splitting, model training and evaluation, performance metrics,
    and visualization functions. Supports multi-layer SOM prediction across
    alpine, treeline, and below-treeline elevation bands.
